---
// src/pages/about.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/common/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us"
  description="Learn about the engineering philosophy and mission behind Free Accurate Calculator: mathematically verified online calculation tools with zero clutter and instant performance."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'About Us' }]} />

    <div class="space-y-4 mb-8">
      <span class="mono-eyebrow text-link">Mission & Architecture</span>
      <h1 class="heading-lg text-ink">About Free Accurate Calculator</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-body">
        Engineering modern, mathematically transparent calculation tools for an international audience.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
      <section class="rounded-[12px] border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Why We Built This Platform</h2>
        <p>
          Most legacy calculator portals were created over two decades ago. While functional, they have become cluttered with dense banner ads, confusing multi-step forms, and outdated formulas that assume every visitor lives in the United States and uses US Dollar denominations.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Free Accurate Calculator</strong> was engineered from the ground up to solve these frustrations. We set out to build an industrial-grade calculator suite with a clean developer-grade aesthetic (inspired by Vercel’s Geist design system), lightning-fast edge performance, and genuine international awareness.
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="rounded-[12px] border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-6 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-[6px] bg-link/10 border border-link/20 text-link">
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">1. Mathematical Verification</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-body leading-relaxed">
            Every calculator formula is verified against official reference standards—whether that is the World Health Organization (WHO) BMI classifications, ISO interest conventions, or reducing-balance banking formulas.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-[12px] border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-6 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-[6px] bg-cyan/10 border border-cyan/20 text-cyan">
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">2. International Scope</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-body leading-relaxed">
            We adapt to the world’s top English-speaking economies (US, UK, Canada, Australia, India, Ireland, New Zealand, Singapore, UAE, South Africa) with country-specific numbering systems, currency formats, and metric/imperial switchers.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-[12px] border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-6 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-[6px] bg-violet/10 border border-violet/20 text-violet">
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">3. Zero Cold Start Performance</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-body leading-relaxed">
            By compiling every calculator statically with Astro and deploying to Cloudflare’s global edge network, pages load within milliseconds on any device and network connection.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-[12px] border border-hairline bg-canvas-elevated p-6 space-y-3">
          <div class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-[6px] bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 text-ink">
            <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-ink">4. Respect for Privacy</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-body leading-relaxed">
            No mandatory registration, no intrusive telemetry, and no storage of personal financial entries on our servers. Your calculations belong to you alone.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
